WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.767 --> 00:00:02.033
-Welcome back.

00:00:02.033 --> 00:00:03.767
Thank you so much
for coming back to the show.

00:00:03.767 --> 00:00:05.934
I have so many things
I want to ask you about.

00:00:05.934 --> 00:00:09.133
First is Phoenix, the baby.
How old is he?

00:00:09.133 --> 00:00:11.067
-He just turned nine months
old yesterday.

00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:12.801
-Nine months old.
Congratulations.

00:00:12.801 --> 00:00:13.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:13.934 --> 00:00:15.934
Get ready to see
the cutest baby.

00:00:15.934 --> 00:00:17.701
Look at this baby.
[ Audience awwing ]

00:00:17.701 --> 00:00:20.300
-Yeah, that's his Halloween --
one of his Halloween costumes.

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:22.267
-Oh, my gosh, he's so cute.

00:00:22.267 --> 00:00:24.234
-It's his first time
in New York.

00:00:24.234 --> 00:00:26.968
-Ooh!
How's he taken to traveling?

00:00:26.968 --> 00:00:28.567
-He is an amazing traveler,

00:00:28.567 --> 00:00:31.534
but this is his first time
experiencing jet lag.

00:00:31.534 --> 00:00:34.868
So he's been up till,
like, midnight, 1 a.m.

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:36.234
Yeah.
-Wow.

00:00:36.234 --> 00:00:39.501
He's ready to party.
-Yeah.

00:00:39.501 --> 00:00:41.934
-Is this true?
His first word was mama?

00:00:41.934 --> 00:00:44.033
-No, it was "yas."

00:00:44.033 --> 00:00:46.334
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.334 --> 00:00:47.667
-It was not.

00:00:47.667 --> 00:00:50.434
There is no way. He said "yas"?
-Yes.

00:00:50.434 --> 00:00:51.300
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:52.801
Yas.
-Yas.

00:00:52.801 --> 00:00:53.934
-Wonder where he got that from.

00:00:53.934 --> 00:00:56.133
-I wonder where he got that
from, yeah.

00:00:56.133 --> 00:00:58.467
Last time I think
you said "Stars Are Blind"

00:00:58.467 --> 00:01:00.801
was the baby's favorite song.
-Mm-hmm.

00:01:00.801 --> 00:01:02.267
-Your song. Is that still true?

00:01:02.267 --> 00:01:04.267
-Yes.
He has amazing taste in music.

00:01:04.267 --> 00:01:05.934
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.934 --> 00:01:06.934
-Speaking of music,
by the way,

00:01:06.934 --> 00:01:08.400
you have a new one coming out.

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:10.567
-Yeah, I'm recording
the new album right now.

00:01:10.567 --> 00:01:11.534
-Now, what is it --

00:01:11.534 --> 00:01:14.367
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:14.367 --> 00:01:17.467
Talk to me about, "Lighter."
This is coming out, "Lighter."

00:01:17.467 --> 00:01:18.734
-"Lighter" comes out this week.

00:01:18.734 --> 00:01:20.868
It's my new song
with Steve Aoki.

00:01:20.868 --> 00:01:24.334
-Steve Aoki is my fave.
-Mm-hmm. He's so dope.

00:01:24.334 --> 00:01:26.534
We've been friends for 20 years.
I love him so much.

00:01:26.534 --> 00:01:28.501
-Any other collabs that
we can look forward to?

00:01:28.501 --> 00:01:31.367
-I'm doing my new album
and Sia

00:01:31.367 --> 00:01:32.801
is executive producing it.

00:01:32.801 --> 00:01:34.334
[ Audience oohs ]

00:01:34.334 --> 00:01:36.701
-Wait. The Sia?
-The Sia.

00:01:36.701 --> 00:01:39.067
-Wow, this is unbelievable.
-Thank you.

00:01:39.067 --> 00:01:40.400
-When is that going to come out?

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:42.267
-That'll be out next year.
-Wow.

00:01:42.267 --> 00:01:46.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:48.634
-I love all the things you do.

00:01:48.634 --> 00:01:50.901
I always find them so,
so interesting.

00:01:50.901 --> 00:01:53.801
This is this is a picture of you
at the Grammys, by the way,

00:01:53.801 --> 00:01:56.868
and you're holding
a bedazzled martini.

00:01:56.868 --> 00:01:59.300
But it turned out that is not.
That was actually a handbag.

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:00.868
Is that correct?
-Yes.

00:02:00.868 --> 00:02:02.367
Peter Dundas designed it.

00:02:02.367 --> 00:02:06.167
And it's a Grey Goose
Swarovski crystal bag. Yeah.

00:02:06.167 --> 00:02:09.300
-And so what's the partnership
with Grey Goose?

00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:12.400
-I am their new
creative director, so...

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:14.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:14.334 --> 00:02:17.100
-So what does that mean?
What does that mean exactly?

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:20.033
And how did I pass up this job?
I don't understand.

00:02:20.033 --> 00:02:22.801
-Well, since I'm the queen
of sliving, it's...

00:02:22.801 --> 00:02:24.100
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:26.200
It's really about
just teaching people

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:28.300
how to slive their best lives

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:31.968
while drinking Grey Goose
martinis.

00:02:31.968 --> 00:02:33.334
-Yaaaas.

00:02:33.334 --> 00:02:35.400
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:38.534
Yeah. Do you
make a good martini?

00:02:38.534 --> 00:02:40.634
-I do now because it just
comes in the bottle.

00:02:40.634 --> 00:02:42.367
All you do is pour it, stir it.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.367 --> 00:02:44.133
Drink it.

00:02:44.133 --> 00:02:45.501
-I guess that's one way
to do it.

00:02:45.501 --> 00:02:48.467
Yeah. Why not? Yeah. Can we talk
about "Paris in Love"?

00:02:48.467 --> 00:02:50.234
This is coming back
for a second season.

00:02:50.234 --> 00:02:52.000
Yes.
-Apparently this is true.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:54.701
The scene is in this episode.

00:02:54.701 --> 00:02:55.901
I don't know if we're going
to show it tonight,

00:02:55.901 --> 00:02:57.968
but it's in this season
of your mom, Kathy,

00:02:57.968 --> 00:03:01.200
finding out for the first time
that she's a grandma.

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:02.934
You introduce her to the baby?

00:03:02.934 --> 00:03:07.434
-Yes. Nobody knew about Phoenix
besides Carter and I.

00:03:07.434 --> 00:03:08.534
-Like no one?
-No one.

00:03:08.534 --> 00:03:10.000
-You didn't tell your mom?

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:11.267
-I didn't tell anyone.

00:03:11.267 --> 00:03:13.234
-Now, this is a problem.
-None of my friends

00:03:13.234 --> 00:03:15.100
or my family. No one knew.
-Why not?

00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:17.167
Why not Mom?

00:03:17.167 --> 00:03:19.167
-[ Laughs ]
Because it was a surprise.

00:03:19.167 --> 00:03:22.133
I feel like if she would have
came on here, said something.

00:03:22.133 --> 00:03:24.000
-She would have, right?
-It's hard to keep in.

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:25.434
I think it's something
that's so exciting

00:03:25.434 --> 00:03:26.634
when your daughter
is going to have a baby,

00:03:26.634 --> 00:03:28.033
it's really hard to keep in.

00:03:28.033 --> 00:03:29.834
-Yes, honestly,
knowing your mom,

00:03:29.834 --> 00:03:31.267
she would have
spilled the beans.

00:03:31.267 --> 00:03:32.601
-Yes.
-I would have --

00:03:32.601 --> 00:03:34.100
She would have just said,
"by the way" and just said it.

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:36.634
-She's just not a good liar.
Someone would have asked her.

00:03:36.634 --> 00:03:39.434
-If she doesn't know,
then she can't tell anyone.

00:03:39.434 --> 00:03:41.534
Yeah.
So how did you do it?

00:03:41.534 --> 00:03:45.167
-Well, I came in and I
had Phoenix under a blanket,

00:03:45.167 --> 00:03:47.801
and I said,
"Two surprises for you."

00:03:47.801 --> 00:03:50.934
And then first, I gave her
a baby blue Chanel bag.

00:03:50.934 --> 00:03:53.701
Because, you know, who could
be mad after getting Chanel?

00:03:53.701 --> 00:03:55.000
[ Laughter ]

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:57.300
And then I said, "And here's
the second surprise,"

00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:59.300
and the blanket came down,

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:03.000
and you'll have to watch
the show and see what happens.

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:04.534
-Were there tears?

00:04:04.534 --> 00:04:07.901
-There is. Yes.
It was emotional. It was...

00:04:07.901 --> 00:04:10.167
It was such a special moment
too, though.

00:04:10.167 --> 00:04:11.534
-It really was.
Yeah.

00:04:11.534 --> 00:04:13.367
Please give my best to your mom
and your dad, by the way.

00:04:13.367 --> 00:04:16.100
They've always been great to me.
I want to show everyone a clip.

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:19.000
Here's Paris Hilton in season
two of "Paris in Love."

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:20.067
Take a look at this.

00:04:27.367 --> 00:04:30.501
-It's amazing.
We're gonna be parents.

00:04:30.501 --> 00:04:32.434
-I'm so excited.

00:04:32.434 --> 00:04:34.200
His name is going to be Phoenix.

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:37.934
I've always wanted to name
my children after cities

00:04:37.934 --> 00:04:39.601
or states or countries.

00:04:39.601 --> 00:04:42.300
So when I told Carter
the name, he loved it.

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:44.567
I just don't even know
what to expect.

00:04:44.567 --> 00:04:46.133
Like, I know expect a baby,

00:04:46.133 --> 00:04:50.734
but I have never had
my own baby, so I don't know.

00:04:50.734 --> 00:04:52.567
♪♪

00:04:52.567 --> 00:04:57.167
Oh, my goodness.
I'm gonna be a mom.

00:04:57.167 --> 00:04:58.968
-Get ready. No spoilers.
It's so good.

00:04:58.968 --> 00:05:01.501
Paris Hilton, everybody.
Season two of

00:05:01.501 --> 00:05:05.000
"Paris in Love" premieres
November 30th on Peacock.

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:07.467
We'll be right back
with stand-up from Jared Freid.

00:05:07.467 --> 00:05:08.968
Stick around, everybody.

